  (text "0 to +12 dB (charGainDb)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 106.68 114.3 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "cd1cfbae-9776-5f29-acc9-9294945d1d97"))
  (text "Section 4 of the circuit notes, stage 4. A pre-clip mid boost or cut of about +/-15 dB is reported for the series [3];\nits circuit is not public. UX3: a graphic-EQ band (chosen) at +/-15 dB (charRange); LX1 is a simulated inductor (gyrator).\nDrawn at noon: the DSP also glides the centre from 250 Hz (Character 0) to 700 Hz (Character 100) at Q 0.7, which a second\ngang in the gyrator would do. UX4 with RVX4: the extra gain of up to 12 dB above noon (charGainDb, chosen; the manual [1] says\nCharacter adds gain above noon). RVX4 is a further gang, at 0 Ohm from Character 0 to 50." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 25.4 198.12 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "72586f82-440a-50cf-8d00-36b148f3a7fa"))
